{
  "name": "Occult Association: Rosicrucian (Tier 2)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Rosicrucian</strong></p><p><strong>“I don’t preach Enlightenment. I smuggle it.”</strong></p><p>Your network makes progress easier to sustain. People advance faster when the path is lit — and when someone is quietly removing the traps.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction / Party Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When the party earns Enlightenment Points or meets narrative criteria for advancement, increase the rate of progress by <strong>10%</strong> (GM adjudicates exact pacing benefits)</li></ul><p>This is not a miracle. This is logistics — and Rosicrucians have always been very good at logistics.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> accelerated progress strains the chain supporting it. Expect supply burden, mentor fatigue, increased expectations, or rival attention once advancement starts looking organized instead of accidental.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
